              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Your Job is to analyze data : {{$context.$nodes.GETCHANGEPARTICIPANTS.$output}}  and generated messageListWidget pattern with TITLE as \"Stakeholder Summary\"\n\nFollow Instruction: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nFor each item with `ResponseValue`  not equal to  \"Approved\" or \"Cancelled\" :\n\nFORMAT INSTRUCTIONS\n\n TITLE\n<[Short description of the problem. Do Not include Approver/User.]>\n\n SUBTITLE\nOne short sentence reason any risks if issues are not resolved.\n\nSUMMARY\nMust be one sentence and max 50 words. Only include issue details & Impact with critical data points. DO NOT include Actions/Recommendations.\n\nTIMESTAMP\nDo Not Populate"
            }
